{
 "section_summary": "This section contains seven consecutive Joint Army–Air weekly intelligence reports from Tokyo, dated July 8 through August 26, 1949, with Department of State telegram cover sheets for six of them. They track Japanese railway dismissals, repatriates and politics; military and political developments in Korea; Philippine elections and Huk activity; and conditions in the Ryukyus and Guam. The final report continues beyond page 292.",
